Sval: Remove telemetry-only components

Sval sends no telemetry (CONTRIBUTING.md rule 4), and these components
do nothing else. Search results page telemetry (its actor, which watched
every https page, the categorization that downloads site-category lists,
their Remote Settings dump and schemas), captcha detection (its actors
on captcha hosts and the page counters it reads), content relevancy and
its Suggest ranking mode, and Discovery (the add-on recommendation
cookie) go whole, with their startup hooks, prefs, Nimbus features and
tests. Glean metrics other components still declare stay for a
telemetry sweep.

